Description: fate/vvc: test a CRA picture following EOS
 Join two CRA-only excerpts of RAP_A_1 with an EOS NAL unit. Both
 pictures must be output, matching two independent decodes and the
 existing RAP_A_1 reference. Enable crccheck+explode to verify their
 picture hashes.
 .
 Without the decoder fix, the second picture has a duplicate POC in the
 same sequence and is dropped, even though the CLI exits successfully.
 .
 Signed-off-by: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
 Assisted-by: Claude Opus via Claude Code
 Assisted-by: GPT-6 via Codex
 .
 Port to 9.0.2: tests/fate/vvc.mak: placed by 9.0.2 context (no curr-ltrp-alias or mv-clip-wrap tests).
